%% ESP32 WiFi bring-up + setup-portal lifecycle (WifiLink) — incl. the 2026-07 portal fixes.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LoadCreds: boot

    LoadCreds --> Joining: stored creds present
    LoadCreds --> FreshPortal: no creds

    Joining --> Connected: joined < 15 s
    Joining --> JoinFailPortal: 15 s timeout

    state "Fresh onboarding portal" as FreshPortal {
        [*] --> APup
        APup: BLE held OFF · STA quiesced · softAP beacons
        APup: SSID Setup-XXXX (per-device MAC suffix)
    }
    state "Join-fail recovery portal" as JoinFailPortal {
        [*] --> APup2
        APup2: BLE held OFF · setAutoReconnect(false) so the softAP can beacon
    }

    Connected --> [*]: serve /app, /status, OTA; BLE proxy runs
    FreshPortal --> Saved: user picks network (POST /save)
    JoinFailPortal --> Saved: re-provision
    Saved --> [*]: esp_restart → rejoin
